    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer_group" kindref="compound">TimerGroup</ref> class is used to group together related timers into a single report that is printed when the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer_group" kindref="compound">TimerGroup</ref> is destroyed. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is illegal to destroy a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer_group" kindref="compound">TimerGroup</ref> object before all of the Timers in it are gone. A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_timer_group" kindref="compound">TimerGroup</ref> can be specified for a newly created timer in its constructor. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
